      "writtenOn": "2022-03-10T20:58:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Alistair, can we submit a change to add `console\u003dnone` to gki_defconfig CONFIG_CMDLINE? I think this could impact other devices which might be relying on the default console behavior.\n\nWe don\u0027t have another way to diverge \"perf\" and \"debug\" kernel command line.",
      "parentUuid": "3eeaf63e_eeebe80d",
      "revId": "4c571f456085d9f1c10611a58352dc00e95e7a3d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
