      "message": "Trilok: I hear you. We can try. But before I do that, and we collect this feedback over some time, can QC comment on the vendor_boot.img or bootloader-based approach for setting \"console\u003dttynull\"? For what it\u0027s worth, I\u0027m going to make the same change for virtual devices now because I recognize this is an important generic issue to solve.",
